      <memberdef kind="function" id="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_replug_retriever_1a2be88f7e71e829383578ba28b17ac868" prot="public" static="no" const="yes" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type><ref refid="structthemis_1_1rag_1_1_replug_fusion_result" kindref="compound">ReplugFusionResult</ref></type>
        <definition>ReplugFusionResult themis::rag::ReplugRetriever::fuse</definition>
        <argsstring>(const std::string &amp;query, const std::vector&lt; judge::RetrievedDocument &gt; &amp;candidates) const</argsstring>
        <name>fuse</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::rag::ReplugRetriever::fuse</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const std::string &amp;</type>
          <declname>query</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>const std::vector&lt; <ref refid="structthemis_1_1rag_1_1judge_1_1_retrieved_document" kindref="compound">judge::RetrievedDocument</ref> &gt; &amp;</type>
          <declname>candidates</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Score and re-rank candidates by fusing retrieval and LLM scores. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Steps performed:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Drop candidates with retrieval_score &lt; config_.min_retrieval_score.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Normalise retrieval scores to [0, 1].</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Compute LLM scores for each candidate via the injected scorer.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Apply softmax with config_.temperature to LLM raw scores.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Interpolate: fused = (1-λ)*retrieval + λ*llm.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Sort by fused score descending; truncate to config_.top_k.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>The <computeroutput>similarity_score</computeroutput> field of every returned document is set to the fused score.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>query</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>User query. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>candidates</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Retrieved candidate documents. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Fusion result with re-ranked documents and score breakdown. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="include/rag/replug_retriever.h" line="218" column="24" bodyfile="src/rag/replug_retriever.cpp" bodystart="264" bodyend="370"/>
      </memberdef>
      <memberdef kind="function" id="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_replug_retriever_1a034cfc861c9a39b5bfda76d94439fc41" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void themis::rag::ReplugRetriever::updateRetrieverWeights</definition>
        <argsstring>(const ReplugFusionResult &amp;result)</argsstring>
        <name>updateRetrieverWeights</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::rag::ReplugRetriever::updateRetrieverWeights</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const <ref refid="structthemis_1_1rag_1_1_replug_fusion_result" kindref="compound">ReplugFusionResult</ref> &amp;</type>
          <declname>result</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Apply one REPLUG-LSR gradient step to the per-document weight table using the KL-divergence gradient from a previous <ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_replug_retriever_1a2be88f7e71e829383578ba28b17ac868" kindref="member">fuse()</ref>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Update Retriever Weights.</para>
<para>For each document d: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">weight[d]<sp/>+=<sp/>lr<sp/>*<sp/>kl_gradient[d]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">weight[d]<sp/><sp/>=<sp/>clamp(weight[d],<sp/>0,<sp/>1)</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>The updated weights are incorporated in subsequent <ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_replug_retriever_1a2be88f7e71e829383578ba28b17ac868" kindref="member">fuse()</ref> calls by multiplying the retrieval score by weight[d] before normalisation.</para>
<para>No-op when config_.enable_weight_update is false.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>result</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Result from the most recent <ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_replug_retriever_1a2be88f7e71e829383578ba28b17ac868" kindref="member">fuse()</ref> call.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">result</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Input parameter.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
Calls: std::abs(), epsilon(), std::clamp(). </para>
        </detaileddescription>
